  hole FosterParent.beni:33:21                    literal    reads ρ.name
  holes 2: static 1, literal 1, static-key 0, dynamic 0
  site FosterParent.beni:30:5                     unique
  sites 1: unique 1, shared 0, instanced 0, value 0
  markup_value_roots 0 (0% of 1 sites)
  carriers no
  constructors 1: under * 0 (0%)
  pairs 0 over 1 keys and 1 groups (0.00 per key); every key calls 0 of 1 groups (0%)
  reconciler 0 of 0 lists
  patchAll <none>
